  m_Name: Restricted Corridor
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::JusticeIsAWeapon.Data.DialogueNodeSO
  nodeId: Restricted Corridor
  speakerName: 
  lineText: "<b>[ACT 2: Unlocking the Paper Trail]</b>\r\n\r\n | \r\n\r\nA narrow
    6-foot-wide restricted corridor connecting a security booth and archive room
    to a private office and a doorway to back alley. Heavy modern electronic-keypad
    security door at one end, dim overhead strip lighting, cold gray-blue tones with
    deep shadows pooling in the corners. Claustrophobic framing, muted color palette,
    faint rain-shadow patterns from a distant window, cinematic noir lighting, comic
    art style.\r\n\r\nWhere do you want to go?\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r"
